This spell was used by [[DeFoe]] to sever the Huntik team from their Titans, although their Amulets were recovered. {{source|Absent Heroes}} [[Dante Vale]] later used Sorrowbond to contain DeFoe's Amulets. {{source|The Treasures of the Argonauts}}

It was used by [[Shauna]] to take the Eathon Lambert's journal and the [[Amulet of Will]] from Lok. She also tried to take the [[Tao]]'s ring but Lok had hidden it in a glove and she couldn't find it. {{Source|The Secret of Two Generations}}

[[Wilder]] tried, unsuccessfully, to collect the [[Willblade]] by using Sorrowbond to disconnect the [[Casterwill family]] bond from the artifact. He was stopped through the actions of [[Lok Lambert]]. {{source|Cave of the Casterwills}}

Dante later used this spell to neutralize [[Rassimov]]'s Amulets upon his arrest in the [[Valley of the Kings, Egypt]]. However, Sorrowbond was unable to affect the Amulet of [[Legion]] which was hidden inside of Rassimov. {{source|Rassimov's Secret}}[[Category:Magic]]
